B.flq=new A.ef("Fixed: A notes field low in a form scrolls clear of the phone keyboard, Activity's Load more no longer gets stuck, a blank client or group setting no longer hides the company's terms, and an edit screen no longer shows the record through it as it slides in.",B.aZ)
