B.fkC=new A.ef("Updated: Recurring invoices no longer offer Send Email, which always failed. Send Now on a draft sends its first invoice [#13368](https://github.com/invoiceninja/invoiceninja/issues/13368)",B.aZ)
B.fkx=new A.ef("Fixed: Self-hosted Client Portal settings lead with the short portal address again, and a hosted account on a subdomain no longer gets a registration link that 404s.",B.aZ)
B.fkR=new A.ef("Fixed: Custom invoice designs and tax rates save again.",B.aZ)
