B.flv=new A.ef("Added: An Activity timeline. Tap or drag a period to filter the feed, narrow it by date range or category with a count beside each, and use Load more to reach further back. Repeated events are folded together.",B.aZ)
B.fky=new A.ef("Added: Comments and activity on recurring expenses.",B.aZ)
B.fl4=new A.ef("Updated: List density is now set only in Device Settings, which gives each list's search field more room.",B.aZ)
B.fl5=new A.ef("Fixed: Contacts sync on Android could delete or change contacts of your own. It now only changes contacts it created, and leaves alone any that Android merged with one of yours.",B.pQ)
B.fks=new A.ef("Fixed: Typing on the Expenses tab of an invoice no longer saves a duplicate line at every pause.",B.aZ)
B.flh=new A.ef("Fixed: Users who can't create a record no longer see New buttons, the + button or create shortcuts for it.",B.aZ)
B.fki=new A.ef("Fixed: Dashboard Invoices, Payments and Expenses figures for a period still in progress now run to today, matching their trend and drill-down.",B.aZ)
B.flp=new A.ef('Fixed: A list no longer misses its newest records until the next full Sync, Apply to oldest invoice picks the oldest unpaid invoice, and a past-due project no longer reads "On track".',B.aZ)
